# Open the dense unit picker from the empty boot chain and confirm arrival.
# pickerStyle is forced to 'dense' by the settings fixture, so the chooser window
# is Unit.Chooser.Dense.
#
# Route discovered live via the UI trace hooks (planning/headless-emu-plan.md
# §11c): at boot the chain-cursor sits on the header, but pressing a MAIN button
# whose screen column falls over the empty insert section selects that spot and
# its mainReleased -> spotReleased fires EmptyControl:activateChooser directly
# (xroot/Chain/EmptySection.lua) — no cursor-move gesture needed. On the empty
# boot chain the insert section spans MAIN3-MAIN5; MAIN3 is its leftmost, most
# stable column.

# Core mods give the picker real contents (units to list).
!packages core

frames 20
!assert require('Application').getVisibleContext():top():getClassName() == 'Chain.Root'

# Select + release the empty insert spot -> activateChooser -> the dense picker.
press MAIN3
frames 15
!assert require('Application').getVisibleContext():top():getClassName() == 'Unit.Chooser.Dense'

# The observed context/stack route from boot to the open picker. Frame numbers are
# stripped by the runner, so this pins the transition sequence, not the timing.
!trace-golden picker-route

quit
